   /opt/hpc/awx/very/long/directory/name/for/the/awx_nodeinf
   o_scripts/current/kim.donghyeon-with-a-very-long-account-
   name-for-wrapping-test_0123456789.txt 를 덮어쓰고, 01 의
   '등록 후 확인' 에도 자동 입력됩니다
 
